<title>USA: i2 Technologies buys Computer Sciences unit.</title>
<headline>i2 Technologies buys Computer Sciences unit.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Software firm i2 Technologies Inc on Tuesday said it has agreed to acquire the products and services division of Computer Sciences Corp.</p>
<p>Financial details were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Computer Sciences' Operations Planning Group makes Operation Planning Environment optimization software for planning and scheduling.</p>
<p>i2 said it has assumed and is committed to the contractual obligations of the OPE customer base, and had agreed that all employees of OPG will become employees of i2.</p>
</text>
